1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,120
Every important conversation
happens once. You don't get to rehearse.

2
00:00:05,470 --> 00:00:13,550
Vought listens to your live conversation —
separating every speaker, understanding the moment,
whispering the next line into your ear.

3
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:18,400
In under four hundred milliseconds.
Built on the ElevenLabs Speech Engine.

4
00:00:18,750 --> 00:00:22,980
Thirty seconds of recording.
The voice you hear in your ear is yours.

5
00:00:23,330 --> 00:00:32,390
TripleByte closed $1.4M more last quarter.
Suggestion acceptance tripled.
The conversation goes the way it was always supposed to.

6
00:00:32,740 --> 00:00:35,340
Vought. Intelligence for live conversations.

